    <bpmn:process id="W_W4025" name="W4025. Corporate Political Engagement Policy, Governance &amp; Operating Model" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program stand-up; annual review; regulatory/election cycle
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Enterprise program (5 entities)
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Chief Compliance Officer
Participants: Legal (links to VS-100), Compliance (links to VS-119), Govt Affairs (links to VS-104), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Corporate Communications (links to VS-14.3), Board (links to VS-36), ABC (links to VS-86)
Source: workflow W4025 — Corporate Political Engagement Policy, Governance &amp; Operating Model</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4025_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4025_Lane1" name="VP Legal &amp; Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4025_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4025_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4025_Lane2" name="VP Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4025_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4025_Lane3" name="CEO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4025_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4025_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4025_Start5" name="Program stand-up; annual review; regulatory/election cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4025_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4025_Task6" name="VP Legal &amp; Compliance define the political-engagement policy: principles…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: VP Legal &amp; Compliance define the political-engagement policy: principles (lawful, accountable, non-partisan-by-default, transparent), the relationship to ABC (VS-86), government affairs (VS-104), ethics (VS-119), and B2G sales (VS-46); and the prohibitions (corporate contributions to candidates/parties largely prohibited under the Omnibus Election Code and RA 9006)
Responsible (R): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Govt Affairs
Accountable (A): CEO / Board Audit Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4025_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4025_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4025_Task7" name="VP Legal establish governance: a political-engagement oversight (Board…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: VP Legal establish governance: a political-engagement oversight (Board Audit/Risk Committee), an approval authority for any political-adjacent spend/activity, decision rights, and integration with records (VS-88), disclosure (W4032), and speak-up (VS-119)
Responsible (R): VP Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4025_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4025_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4025_Task8" name="CEO/Board ratify the policy, approve budget/resourcing, and cascade as a…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CEO/Board ratify the policy, approve budget/resourcing, and cascade as a board-level risk (links to VS-21.2 ERM and VS-36 governance)
Responsible (R): CEO / Board
Accountable (A): Board Audit Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4025_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4025_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4025_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4025_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4025_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-161 (ensure election-period &amp; political-contribution compliance.) | - operational: dedicated program and policy; operational: clear principles and prohibitions
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Chief Compliance Officer</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4025_Assoc11" sourceRef="W4025_Annotation10" targetRef="W4025_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
