    <bpmn:process id="W_W4026" name="W4026. Political Activity Risk Assessment &amp; Stakeholder / Issue Mapping" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual; election cycle; major policy issue; new region/LGU
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Enterprise + per region/LGU
Owner: VP Legal / Government Affairs Manager
Participants: Legal, Govt Affairs (links to VS-104), Insights (links to VS-44), Compliance (links to VS-119), Strategy (links to VS-33), affected regions
Source: workflow W4026 — Political Activity Risk Assessment &amp; Stakeholder / Issue Mapping</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4026_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4026_Lane1" name="Govt Affairs">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4026_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4026_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4026_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4026_Lane2" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4026_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4026_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4026_Start4" name="Annual; election cycle; major policy issue; new region/LGU">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4026_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4026_Task5" name="Govt Affairs/Legal map political stakeholders (national, regional, LGU…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Govt Affairs/Legal map political stakeholders (national, regional, LGU, regulators) and policy issues material to BuildRight (retail tax/e-invoicing, consumer, labor, customs/tariff, energy, data privacy, property/lease), and assess the political/regulatory risk landscape
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs / Insights / Strategy
Accountable (A): Government Affairs Manager
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4026_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4026_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4026_Task6" name="Legal/Compliance assess political-activity risk by region/entity (election…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal/Compliance assess political-activity risk by region/entity (election cycles, hot-button issues, sensitivity of LGU relationships links to VS-76, B2G exposure links to VS-46), identify prohibited/high-risk activities, and set the engagement guardrails
Responsible (R): Legal / Compliance / Govt Affairs
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4026_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4026_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4026_Task7" name="Govt Affairs/Legal document the assessment, feed it into the engagement plan…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govt Affairs/Legal document the assessment, feed it into the engagement plan (links to VS-104) and the election-period protocol (W4033), and refresh on cycle/change
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Annual + on change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4026_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4026_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4026_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4026_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4026_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-626 (ensure controlled execution — Political Engagement Policy, Governance &amp; Risk Assessment (PA-132.1).) | - operational: monitoring (links to W4040); operational: guardrails
Owner: VP Legal / Government Affairs Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4026_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4026_Annotation9" targetRef="W4026_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
