    <bpmn:process id="W_W4027" name="W4027. Political Contribution &amp; Donation Policy, Approval &amp; Disclosure" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Contribution/donation request; spend decision; disclosure cycle
Frequency: On request + maintained policy
Volume: Occasional (heavily restricted)
Owner: VP Legal / CFO
Participants: Legal, Finance (links to VS-17.4), Compliance (links to VS-119), ABC (links to VS-86), Govt Affairs (links to VS-104), CEO, Board
Source: workflow W4027 — Political Contribution &amp; Donation Policy, Approval &amp; Disclosure</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4027_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4027_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4027_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4027_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4027_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4027_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4027_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4027_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4027_Start4" name="Contribution/donation request; spend decision; disclosure cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4027_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4027_Task5" name="Legal/Finance maintain the political-contribution/donation policy: the general…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal/Finance maintain the political-contribution/donation policy: the general prohibition on corporate contributions to candidates/parties/election campaigns under the Omnibus Election Code and RA 9006; the narrow permitted categories (lawful CSR/community donations links to VS-25.2 with no electoral nexus); approval authority (Board for any political-adjacent spend); and documentation/disclosure requirements
Responsible (R): Legal / Finance / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Legal / CFO
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4027_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4027_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4027_Task6" name="Legal/Compliance review every request or spend that could be construed as…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal/Compliance review every request or spend that could be construed as political (sponsorships of political events, donations to political foundations, in-kind support, candidate-linked charity), apply the ABC controls (links to VS-86) and anti-graft controls (links to W4037), and route to approval or decline
Responsible (R): Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): CEO / Board
Duration: Per request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4027_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4027_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4027_Task7" name="Finance/Legal record and disclose any permitted political-adjacent spend (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/Legal record and disclose any permitted political-adjacent spend (links to W4032 and VS-17.4), and report to the Board Audit Committee (links to VS-36)
Responsible (R): Finance / Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): Board Audit Committee
Duration: Per event + periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4027_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4027_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4027_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4027_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4027_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-161 (ensure election-period &amp; political-contribution compliance.) | - operational: prohibition, review, and Board authority; operational: nexus review and anti-graft controls
Owner: VP Legal / CFO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4027_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4027_Annotation9" targetRef="W4027_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
