    <bpmn:process id="W_W4028" name="W4028. Lobbying, Advocacy &amp; Public-Affairs Activity Governance &amp; Disclosure" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Advocacy activity; lobbying engagement; disclosure cycle
Frequency: Continuous + periodic disclosure
Volume: Ongoing advocacy (links to VS-104)
Owner: VP Legal / Government Affairs Manager
Participants: Govt Affairs (links to VS-104), Legal (links to VS-100), Compliance (links to VS-119), Corporate Communications (links to VS-14.3), Strategy (links to VS-33)
Source: workflow W4028 — Lobbying, Advocacy &amp; Public-Affairs Activity Governance &amp; Disclosure</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4028_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4028_Lane1" name="Govt Affairs">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4028_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4028_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4028_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4028_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4028_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4028_Start3" name="Advocacy activity; lobbying engagement; disclosure cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4028_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4028_Task4" name="Govt Affairs/Legal govern lobbying and advocacy activity (within VS-104)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Govt Affairs/Legal govern lobbying and advocacy activity (within VS-104): define what constitutes lobbying/advocacy, the approval and documentation requirements, the conduct standards (truthful, no improper inducements links to VS-86), and any registration/disclosure obligations (Philippine context and any foreign registration where BuildRight&#x27;s B2B/export activity triggers it)
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4028_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4028_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4028_Task5" name="Govt Affairs/Compliance log all lobbying/advocacy engagements (official met…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Govt Affairs/Compliance log all lobbying/advocacy engagements (official met, topic, position, outcome), maintain a single registry, and ensure conduct aligns with anti-graft (links to W4037) and competition guardrails (links to VS-129 W3965 association protocol)
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4028_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4028_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4028_Task6" name="Govt Affairs/Legal prepare lobbying/advocacy disclosure (links to W4032) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govt Affairs/Legal prepare lobbying/advocacy disclosure (links to W4032) and report activity to the Board (links to VS-36)
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs / Legal
Accountable (A): Board Audit Committee
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4028_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4028_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
