      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Engagement of political-affairs consultant/lobbyist; vendor spend; PAC question
Frequency: Per engagement + maintained
Volume: Occasional
Owner: VP Legal / Government Affairs Manager
Participants: Legal, Govt Affairs (links to VS-104), Procurement (links to VS-34), Compliance (links to VS-119/VS-86), Finance (links to VS-17.4)
Source: workflow W4031 — Political-Engagement Vendor, Consultant &amp; PAC (if any) Management</bpmn:documentation>
