    <bpmn:process id="W_W4032" name="W4032. Political Engagement Records, Transparency &amp; Public Disclosure" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Disclosure cycle; stakeholder request; event
Frequency: Annual + on request
Volume: Enterprise
Owner: VP Legal / CSO
Participants: Legal, Compliance, Govt Affairs (links to VS-104), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Sustainability/ESG (links to VS-25.3), Corporate Communications (links to VS-14.3)
Source: workflow W4032 — Political Engagement Records, Transparency &amp; Public Disclosure</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4032_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4032_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4032_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4032_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4032_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4032_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4032_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4032_Start3" name="Disclosure cycle; stakeholder request; event">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4032_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4032_Task4" name="Legal/Compliance maintain the political-engagement records registry…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal/Compliance maintain the political-engagement records registry: contributions/donations (permitted), lobbying/advocacy engagements, association memberships/dues, political-affairs vendor spend, and any political-adjacent spend — with documentation and approval evidence (links to VS-88)
Responsible (R): Legal / Compliance / Govt Affairs
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4032_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4032_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4032_Task5" name="Legal/Sustainability prepare political-engagement transparency disclosure…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal/Sustainability prepare political-engagement transparency disclosure (integrated into ESG/sustainability reporting links to VS-25.3 or a standalone statement): political contributions (none/prohibited), lobbying/advocacy positions, association memberships, and governance
Responsible (R): Legal / Sustainability / Comms
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4032_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4032_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4032_Task6" name="Legal/Comms manage disclosure risk (sensitivity, accuracy), publish, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Legal/Comms manage disclosure risk (sensitivity, accuracy), publish, and respond to stakeholder/investor/lender queries (links to W4021-equivalent stakeholder engagement and VS-14.3)
Responsible (R): Legal / Comms / Sustainability
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Annual + on request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4032_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4032_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4032_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4032_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4032_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-626 (ensure controlled execution — Political Engagement Policy, Governance &amp; Risk Assessment (PA-132.1).) | - operational: registry and approval gates; operational: accuracy
Owner: VP Legal / CSO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4032_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4032_Annotation8" targetRef="W4032_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
